E do Sr. Gigalto.

241
00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:04.510
do professor?

242
00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.600
O que?

243
00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.770
Venha ao Shinjuka no Umi General Hospital após o exame terminar.

244
00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:27.810
do hospital?

245
